/-!
# VIII09R — R2: `σ₃` under general scaling and sign flip

`σ₃(j) = sigmaB 0 (q₃_j)` is the frozen radial Green functional evaluating the compact source.
The `j³` scaling and oddness are **not** re-integrated here: VIII09 already proves

* `q3j (k*j) = k³ q₃_j` (pointwise, source level),
* `cj_dj_smul`: `c_{k·j} = k³ c_j` and `d_{k·j} = k³ d_j` on the physical exterior (same-source
  uniqueness),
* `cj_lim`: `R c_j(R) → σ₃(j)`.

Hence `R c_{k·j}(R) = k³ (R c_j(R)) → k³ σ₃(j)`, while the same quantity tends to `σ₃(k·j)`; the
far-field limit is unique, so `σ₃(k·j) = k³ σ₃(j)`.  Oddness is `k = −1`.

The `j = 0` zero control is `sigma3_zero` (VIII09.Controls); nothing is re-proved here.
-/

